  "captions": [
    {
      "row": "N1",
      "start": 4,
      "end": 6.694,
      "text": "I found a new coding-agent app."
    },
    {
      "row": "N2",
      "start": 7.794,
      "end": 10.127,
      "text": "Another one? What does this one do?"
    },
    {
      "row": "N3",
      "start": 11.227,
      "end": 16.753,
      "text": "It runs all of us. Side by side. On one plan."
    },
    {
      "row": "N4",
      "start": 17.853,
      "end": 19.478,
      "text": "Huh. What's it called?"
    },
    {
      "row": "N5",
      "start": 20.578,
      "end": 26.151,
      "text": "It's called Ptah. Named after the ancient Egyptian god of builders."
    },
    {
      "row": "O1",
      "start": 27.251,
      "end": 29.584,
      "text": "That's a big name for an app."
    },
    {
      "row": "O3",
      "start": 30.684,
      "end": 33.47,
      "text": "Honestly? It sounds… old."
    },
    {
      "row": "O4",
      "start": 45.57,
      "end": 46.763,
      "text": "Old."
    },
    {
      "row": "D1",
      "start": 48.213,
      "end": 51.546,
      "text": "You said my name. Now look at what I build."
    },
    {
      "row": "D2",
      "start": 52.646,
      "end": 57.244,
      "text": "Respectfully… why does the god of builders care about coding agents?"
    },
    {
      "row": "F1",
      "start": 58.844,
      "end": 65.314,
      "text": "One command center. Every coding agent you already pay for, in one window."
    },
    {
      "row": "F2",
      "start": 66.214,
      "end": 71.576,
      "text": "Give them one plan. They build in parallel, each in its own lane."
    },
    {
      "row": "F3",
      "start": 72.476,
      "end": 77.997,
      "text": "Nothing ships unchecked. You review every change before it lands."
    },
    {
      "row": "F4",
      "start": 78.897,
      "end": 83.679,
      "text": "And every run is tracked. Time, tokens and cost."
    },
    {
      "row": "D5",
      "start": 84.879,
      "end": 89.925,
      "text": "Same craft as my builders. Now it runs on your desktop."
    },
    {
      "row": "D6",
      "start": 91.025,
      "end": 93.951,
      "text": "…okay. That's actually cool."
    }
  ]
}